    },
    {
      "id": "claim_dbc1ffad2109469cba7b1fdbe63bd84a",
      "statement": "The CLI is the engine-host-local surface and is the only one of the three surfaces that skips the network entirely, operating the index, retrieval, write, and serve paths directly.",
