      "id": "claim_6b4a916e5c42442880481feb33ea3362",
      "statement": "connect.py owns serendipity connection proposals — pairing notes with high cosine similarity that no body wikilink already joins — and never writes the suggested link into a source note, emitting a bounded review-gated proposal instead.",
