    {
      "id": "claim_e5810a8438824150be995a7de03288c6",
      "statement": "The engine's runtime dependency set is deliberately small and permissively licensed — the sqlite-vec extension, the OpenAI client, the MCP SDK, and a round-trip-preserving YAML parser used by the frontmatter gate — and each carries an upper version bound because the lockfile is not shipped in the wheel or sdist.",
